## Glass
component-glass = Glass
component-glass-made-of-part = silicon dioxide (sand)
component-glass-description-novice = A transparent solid that conducts heat poorly. Lab glassware is made of heat-resistant glass.
component-glass-description-school = Glass conducts heat tens to hundreds of times worse than metals, so a glass beaker heats slowly. Heat-resistant (borosilicate) glass does not crack when heated quickly.
